msgstr ""

#: ../../source/database/query_builder.rst:796
msgid "$builder->groupEnd()"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/database/query_builder.rst:798
msgid ""
"Ends the current group by adding a closing parenthesis to the **WHERE** "
